# UI/UX & Design System Standards

- **Component Library**: Prefer composition over configuration. Use Radix UI primitives or Shadcn UI patterns.
- **Styling**: Use Tailwind CSS exclusively. Group classes logically: Layout -> Spacing -> Typography -> Visuals (e.g., `flex flex-col items-center p-4 text-lg font-bold bg-white`).
- **Accessibility (a11y)**: 
  - All interactive elements must have `aria-label` or visible text.
  - Ensure keyboard navigability (`tabIndex`, `onKeyDown`).
  - Maintain a minimum WCAG AA contrast ratio for text and backgrounds.
- **Design Tokens**: Never hardcode hex colors or arbitrary pixel values. Use Tailwind theme variables (e.g., `text-primary`, `gap-md`).
